.TH WTWM-CONFIG 1 "August 2026" "wtwm 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
wtwm-config \- validate and inspect a wtwm/twm configuration file
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B wtwm-config
.I file
.SH DESCRIPTION
Parses a twm configuration file using the same configuration engine as wtwm
and prints the effective settings, bindings, menus, functions, and the number
of accepted compatibility directives that do not yet affect Wayland state.
